<!doctype lake><title>❄️ 𝓐𝓽𝓽𝓮𝓷𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="hVNBw" id="hVNBw" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u88cfa272" id="u88cfa272">🦄</span><span data-lake-id="u02a0d21a" id="u02a0d21a"> 𝐦𝐇𝐂: 𝐌𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐟𝐨𝐥𝐝-𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐝 𝐇𝐲𝐩𝐞𝐫-𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐧𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ufe49745d" id="ufe49745d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud6d41179" id="ud6d41179">自残差网络提出以来，深度神经网络架构经历快速演进。单层结构可形式化表示为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2aaac187" id="u2aaac187" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl%2B1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%2B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BW%7D_l)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf0d1366513b5bc29bc71c996466a48a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yMIco%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="udba52f71"><li fid="ubb2736b2" data-lake-id="u9255f024" id="u9255f024"><span data-lake-id="u97f2e74b" id="u97f2e74b">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81f745cc7a87af591db65d22e8727b3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DGuKs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub53701ac" id="ub53701ac">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F190138a60e3dca95dc9fbb45e36b1990.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nkEQV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u26083090" id="u26083090">分别表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jqxE3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69aec40e" id="u69aec40e">层的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M2E4g%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2ba5e2be" id="u2ba5e2be">维输入与输出，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F866abb1990d6b778e2d9be51f6696f78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pyzWX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4d1f6b4" id="ud4d1f6b4">表示残差函数。尽管残差函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F866abb1990d6b778e2d9be51f6696f78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mc85o%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b48f637" id="u8b48f637">在过去十年间不断演进，涵盖卷积、注意力机制和前馈网络等多种运算，但残差连接范式始终保持着最初的形式</span></li><li fid="ubb2736b2" data-lake-id="u3f7b795c" id="u3f7b795c"><span data-lake-id="ua4227750" id="ua4227750">早期研究揭示，残差连接的恒等映射性质能够维持大规模训练的稳定性与效率。将残差连接递归展开至多个层，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue82f70f0" id="ue82f70f0" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_L%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3Dl%7D%5E%7BL-1%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BW%7D_i)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef6de3e3e143adc67ca6b1260485ef9e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Udqht%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua12699fa" id="ua12699fa"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3ec0f56" id="ue3ec0f56">近期，以超连接为代表的研究为残差连接引入新的设计维度，并通过实验验证其性能潜力。通过扩宽残差流并增加连接复杂度，HC 在不改变单个计算单元浮点运算量开销的情况下，显著提升网络拓扑的复杂度。形式上，HC 的单层传播定义为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uef34ee33" id="uef34ee33" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl%2B1%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%2B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BW%7D_l)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F199febab05c8446bf66dc864626514b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TVpYF%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u597832e4"><li fid="ue458ef14" data-lake-id="ue9b3831b" id="ue9b3831b"><span data-lake-id="u9a4b2cb1" id="u9a4b2cb1">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81f745cc7a87af591db65d22e8727b3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mB6Nm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17f70af4" id="u17f70af4">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F190138a60e3dca95dc9fbb45e36b1990.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UDYOq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6df94af5" id="u6df94af5">分别表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ocNkA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f922e24" id="u7f922e24">层的输入与输出。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81f745cc7a87af591db65d22e8727b3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dtaDr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6534f28c" id="u6534f28c">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F190138a60e3dca95dc9fbb45e36b1990.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Tx6QT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72b3101c" id="u72b3101c">的特征维度由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m9JQQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc71dc489" id="uc71dc489">扩展为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%5C%5Ctimes%20C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1fbed31c920e4a8147bfb86744a47a53.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22No82I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1c8f78ee" id="u1c8f78ee">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hRTs1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28089e6f" id="u28089e6f">为扩展倍率。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c7e8d7c1e7d51245693f6dd60117a1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UksXj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d49654d" id="u3d49654d">表示一个可学习映射，用于在残差流内部混合特征。同样作为可学习映射，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc2da19a046a0f90a5742bd9c1e3fe11.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RujZM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub88ae3d1" id="ub88ae3d1">将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22nC%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5d713aebbed3eae30fced6dae8937e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VyMrL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueefd51dd" id="ueefd51dd">维残差流中的特征聚合为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aIwuR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7990a311" id="u7990a311">维的层输入，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdbdee77c1d6b0c4307afcda41d7c4111.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22neiU3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50ace34c" id="u50ace34c">则将层输出映射回残差流</span></li><li fid="ue458ef14" data-lake-id="ub21af754" id="ub21af754"><span data-lake-id="u2552e4c6" id="u2552e4c6">随着训练规模扩大，HC 会引入潜在的不稳定风险。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue57704d6" id="ue57704d6" style="color: #5C0036">当架构扩展至多个层时，HC 的无约束性质会破坏恒等映射性质。在包含多个并行流的架构中，理想的恒等映射发挥着守恒机制的作用，确保跨流的平均信号强度在前向传播和反向传播过程中均保持不变</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc5217924" id="uc5217924">。将 HC 递归展开至多个层，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u00fe1310" id="u00fe1310" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_L%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL-l%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_%7BL-i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3Dl%7D%5E%7BL-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7BL-1-i%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_%7BL-j%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_i%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_i%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BW%7D_i)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff5325a0f2d90d323bfcd8d8a1d05d1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xpGI7%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc0a556ff"><li fid="u584e892e" data-lake-id="u9a06353a" id="u9a06353a"><strong><span data-lake-id="udb34ba72" id="udb34ba72" style="color: #5C8D07">HC 中的复合映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL-l%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_%7BL-i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fc38ebd543745e2380019815dfaaf72.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PTcVA%22%7D" style="color: #5C8D07"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf2c65d72" id="uf2c65d72" style="color: #5C8D07">无法保持特征的全局均值。这一差异会导致信号出现无界放大或衰减，从而引发大规模训练中的不稳定性</span></strong></li><li fid="u584e892e" data-lake-id="u84f5d0c9" id="u84f5d0c9"><span data-lake-id="udcc12a3e" id="udcc12a3e">尽管 HC 在 FLOPs 层面维持计算效率，但其原始设计并未解决残差流扩宽后访存开销所带来的硬件效率问题。这些因素共同限制 HC 在实际应用中的可扩展性，并阻碍其在大规模训练中的应用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u491d62b6" id="u491d62b6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u351b4ab8" id="u351b4ab8" style="color: #AD1A2B">作者提出流形约束超连接：通过将 HC 的残差连接空间投影到特定流形上来恢复恒等映射性质，同时结合系统性的基础设施优化以保证效率</span></strong></p><ul list="u6e79fa6b"><li fid="u3c9c9a2f" data-lake-id="u0f37b957" id="u0f37b957"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5c8dd167" id="u5c8dd167" style="color: #00346B">mHC 利用 Sinkhorn–Knopp 算法，以熵投影的方式将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KB5fw%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0894e28" id="uc0894e28" style="color: #00346B">投影到 Birkhoff 多面体上。这一操作将残差连接矩阵有效地约束在由双随机矩阵构成的流形内。由于这些矩阵的行和与列和均为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sSvOE%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b1d7d04" id="u1b1d7d04" style="color: #00346B">，运算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F920c38d728d20f954b3612003a4618c7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TCa8W%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u954c0257" id="u954c0257" style="color: #00346B">相当于对输入特征进行凸组合</span></strong></li><li fid="u3c9c9a2f" data-lake-id="u948086e4" id="u948086e4"><span data-lake-id="u4ea8b8fa" id="u4ea8b8fa">这一特性使信号传播具有良好的数值条件：特征均值保持不变，信号范数受到严格约束，从而有效缓解信号消失或爆炸的风险</span></li><li fid="u3c9c9a2f" data-lake-id="u3dfa6da6" id="u3dfa6da6"><span data-lake-id="uaaa44f4a" id="uaaa44f4a">由于双随机矩阵集合在矩阵乘法下具有封闭性，复合映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL-l%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_%7BL-i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fc38ebd543745e2380019815dfaaf72.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gcDuh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e456997" id="u0e456997">仍然保留这一守恒性质。mHC 能够有效维持任意深度之间恒等映射的稳定性</span></li><li fid="u3c9c9a2f" data-lake-id="ubfd65ad8" id="ubfd65ad8"><span data-lake-id="ua5d8642e" id="ua5d8642e">为保证效率，采用内核融合，并基于 TileLang 开发混合精度内核。通过选择性重计算降低显存占用，并在 DualPipe 调度中精心安排通信的重叠执行</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u47166d57" id="u47166d57" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790814949334-b81b4a2e-7be0-4b11-baa4-8d2026177e35.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0bfbd2eb-6689-4568-a928-8fe7390d1aa%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8cff8c00-524b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A851%2C%22height%22%3A440%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A139386%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1345%2C%22originHeight%22%3A695%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22C)MANIFOLD-CONSTRAINEDHC(MHC)%22%2C%22x%22%3A910%2C%22y%22%3A657%2C%22width%22%3A407%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A)RESIDUALCONNECTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A658%2C%22width%22%3A268%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BHYPER-CONNECTIONS(HC%22%2C%22x%22%3A466%2C%22y%22%3A659%2C%22width%22%3A307%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PREMAPPING%22%2C%22x%22%3A1147%2C%22y%22%3A518%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PREMAPPING%22%2C%22x%22%3A660%2C%22y%22%3A518%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSTMAPPING%22%2C%22x%22%3A1143%2C%22y%22%3A246%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSTMAPPING%22%2C%22x%22%3A654%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PMPOSTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A1140%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PPREHC%22%2C%22x%22%3A1148%2C%22y%22%3A542%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESMAPPING%22%2C%22x%22%3A944%2C%22y%22%3A521%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESMAPPING%22%2C%22x%22%3A458%2C%22y%22%3A520%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRESHTES%22%2C%22x%22%3A941%2C%22y%22%3A543%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERF%22%2C%22x%22%3A682%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERF%22%2C%22x%22%3A1169%2C%22y%22%3A394%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HCRES%22%2C%22x%22%3A477%2C%22y%22%3A539%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAYERF%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A394%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HCPRE%22%2C%22x%22%3A671%2C%22y%22%3A541%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POST%22%2C%22x%22%3A659%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1181%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A695%2C%22y%22%3A317%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POST%22%2C%22x%22%3A1166%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IPOST%22%2C%22x%22%3A684%2C%22y%22%3A162%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A477%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%2B1%22%2C%22x%22%3A965%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22H%5C%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A700%2C%22y%22%3A444%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HP%22%2C%22x%22%3A1188%2C%22y%22%3A444%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HFE%22%2C%22x%22%3A979%2C%22y%22%3A445%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ebeae9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0c57aa61%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="qMVBW" id="qMVBW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua0817f44" id="ua0817f44">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="ufcd939bd" id="ufcd939bd"> 𝐑𝐞𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5b1292ac" id="u5b1292ac"><strong><span data-lake-id="u56850429" id="u56850429">微观设计关注计算模块的内部架构，规定特征在空间、时间和通道维度上的处理方式。相比之下，宏观设计确定计算模块之间的拓扑结构，从而决定特征表示如何在不同层之间传播、路由和合并</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u1b5ec124" id="u1b5ec124"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e9b3e13" id="u4e9b3e13">凭借参数共享和平移不变性，卷积最初在结构化信号处理中占据主导地位。随后，深度可分离卷积和分组卷积等变体提升计算效率，而 Transformer 的出现则确立注意力机制与前馈网络作为现代架构基本组成模块的地位。注意力机制促进全局信息传播，FFNs 则增强单个特征的表示能力</span></strong></p><ul list="u50123181"><li fid="u262076f0" data-lake-id="u0c1d63fe" id="u0c1d63fe"><span data-lake-id="u2b2ccead" id="u2b2ccead">为在模型性能与大语言模型的计算需求之间取得平衡，注意力机制逐渐发展出多查询注意力、分组查询注意力和多头潜在注意力等高效变体</span></li><li fid="u262076f0" data-lake-id="u1d11bbe8" id="u1d11bbe8"><span data-lake-id="u15770a16" id="u15770a16">与此同时，FFNs 通过混合专家被推广为稀疏计算范式，使参数规模能够大幅扩展，而无需按比例增加计算成本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u423db2ab" id="u423db2ab"><strong><span data-lake-id="u97a10bbe" id="u97a10bbe" style="color: #663000">宏观设计决定网络的全局拓扑结构。继 ResNet 之后，DenseNet 和 FractalNet 等架构分别通过稠密连接和多路径结构增加拓扑复杂度，以提升模型性能。深层聚合通过递归聚合不同深度与分辨率的特征，进一步扩展这一范式</span></strong></p><ul list="uebc1c143"><li fid="u017e048c" data-lake-id="u226abd46" id="u226abd46"><span data-lake-id="u5e1c59d9" id="u5e1c59d9">近期，宏观设计的研究重点逐渐转向扩宽残差流。超连接引入可学习矩阵，以调节不同深度特征之间的连接强度</span></li><li fid="u017e048c" data-lake-id="u2d298a13" id="u2d298a13"><span data-lake-id="u678d6320" id="u678d6320">残差矩阵 Transformer 则使用外积记忆矩阵替代标准残差流，以支持特征存储。类似地，MUDDFormer 采用多路动态稠密连接来优化跨层信息流</span></li><li fid="u017e048c" data-lake-id="ue8cf6a7f" id="ue8cf6a7f"><span data-lake-id="u2c6d0bf8" id="u2c6d0bf8">尽管这些方法展现出一定潜力，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubfc93947" id="ubfc93947" style="color: #270070">但它们会破坏残差连接固有的恒等映射性质，从而引入不稳定性并限制可扩展性。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud65ddb6e" id="ud65ddb6e">此外，特征宽度的扩展还会带来显著的访存开销</span></li><li fid="u017e048c" data-lake-id="u899b4b2d" id="u899b4b2d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue1f5a424" id="ue1f5a424" style="color: #AD1A2B">在 HC 的基础上，本文提出的 mHC 将残差连接空间约束在特定流形上，以恢复恒等映射性质，同时结合系统性的基础设施优化来保证效率。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1fb48dd5" id="u1fb48dd5">该方法在保留连接扩展所带来的拓扑优势的同时，提升稳定性与可扩展性</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="hvfHN" id="hvfHN" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u30debd8c" id="u30debd8c">🐧</span><span data-lake-id="u75fefa9c" id="u75fefa9c"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐲</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua56c18e2" id="ua56c18e2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u67c08468" id="u67c08468">在 HC 的形式化定义中，将第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rgSyp%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u27538036" id="u27538036">层的输入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3d59d379ff557e8027a707c9a00a9546.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wADKw%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb8de8ea" id="ufb8de8ea">扩展</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e6fJk%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc8ee14dd" id="uc8ee14dd">倍，以构建隐状态矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%3D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl%2C0%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl%2Cn-1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed9d84d2abc76e51e80afa1e2a16ed54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EZxGU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5096a806" id="u5096a806">，该矩阵可视为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f13sL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5fc82a04" id="u5fc82a04">路残差流。为控制残差流的读取、写入和更新过程，HC 引入三个可学习的线性映射：</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F82d0e0542b75caf3e50050d1eefb550d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DRDcb%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucf881c0e" id="ucf881c0e">，以及</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c7e8d7c1e7d51245693f6dd60117a1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hte7x%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue2573539"><li fid="u0d10a6d9" data-lake-id="uf1840508" id="uf1840508"><span data-lake-id="u0211ed38" id="u0211ed38">在 HC 中，可学习映射由两部分系数组成：依赖于输入的部分与全局部分，分别称为动态映射和静态映射</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7fddc272" id="u7fddc272" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%3D%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Ctanh(%5C%5Ctheta_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Ctanh(%5C%5Ctheta_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Ctanh(%5C%5Ctheta_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb6bc35cf5c19f22fc0124412e07aee19.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oyeOL%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8ad2506a"><li fid="u99160d73" data-lake-id="u947f834b" id="u947f834b"><span data-lake-id="u7f755390" id="u7f755390">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92ae25fa226eb0b1d0547b7038d5fc96.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E73Tu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6ef321bd" id="u6ef321bd">作用于最后一个维度；标量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7740e62d86df9640cabda76bebd67cd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l8PCN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u019ed668" id="u019ed668">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fad4644789b6c4a4d566cfa54491f12a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yq3MF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8213c5e" id="uf8213c5e">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6f7e6d726551fcdafdd11b8b270f695.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JY3WV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufb71a2d4" id="ufb71a2d4">是可学习的门控因子，初始化为较小的值。动态映射由线性投影得到，其参数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Ctheta_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5e01d8670132bbcd67c55619e5c12b95.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CnIVx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60e68d03" id="u60e68d03">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff2b8d5c64482f7e65b982de55fad1bc5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZZBOK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube4af2d3" id="ube4af2d3">；静态映射则由可学习偏置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F60d806915eb165cb3258b6722886eb9b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aHzHx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u990b4fce" id="u990b4fce">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcfcf511be3cf1d12d29788bb270c4c30.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jdvGS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7c10ebc" id="uc7c10ebc">表示</span></li><li fid="u99160d73" data-lake-id="u87c25a66" id="u87c25a66"><span data-lake-id="u2578e23c" id="u2578e23c">引入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07375c9910e7b9fb1e747669897c4da2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mueqh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u35e92abc" id="u35e92abc">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38f3cb5e515458146afee58e905e3d14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VMoCK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f87a909" id="u4f87a909">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vpQm0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18c6d284" id="u18c6d284">这些映射所带来的计算开销可以忽略，因为典型扩展倍率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pB06E%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04a3db26" id="u04a3db26">远小于输入维度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa42a4fc28b384cc408de066beed57485.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GkzNu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube4bfcfe" id="ube4bfcfe">。通过这一设计，HC 有效地将残差流的信息容量与层输入维度解耦，而后者与模型的计算复杂度密切相关</span></li><li fid="u99160d73" data-lake-id="ufce2446e" id="ufce2446e"><span data-lake-id="u7304ef93" id="u7304ef93">尽管 HC 需要通过三个映射来处理残差流与层输入之间的维度不匹配，但初步实验表明，残差映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xyr3t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90f41a49" id="u90f41a49">带来的性能提升最为显著</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub1a74c99" id="ub1a74c99"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue75369ff" id="ue75369ff">尽管残差映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Eu0WN%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf9b866b7" id="uf9b866b7">对性能至关重要，但其逐层连续应用会对数值稳定性构成显著风险。当 HC 扩展至多个层时，从第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22paK8W%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3ef100d" id="ub3ef100d">层到第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xYihe%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5d68dba1" id="u5d68dba1">层的有效信号传播由复合映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL-l%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_%7BL-i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fc38ebd543745e2380019815dfaaf72.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wUmUj%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf58ed4bc" id="uf58ed4bc">决定。由于可学习映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Enn9j%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9190920d" id="u9190920d">不受约束，这一复合映射不可避免地会偏离恒等映射</span></strong></p><ul list="u177393a4"><li fid="u2b2a2066" data-lake-id="ua675e3eb" id="ua675e3eb"><span data-lake-id="ud07f6ac3" id="ud07f6ac3">因此，在前向传播和反向传播过程中，信号幅值都容易出现爆炸或消失。这一现象破坏残差学习依赖于信号畅通传播的基本前提，从而使更深或更大规模模型的训练过程变得不稳定</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua5d569fb" id="ua5d569fb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4e4a6e43" id="u4e4a6e43">尽管额外映射的线性性质使 HC 的计算复杂度保持在可控范围内，但系统层面的开销仍构成不可忽视的挑战。具体而言，访存开销往往是现代模型架构的主要瓶颈之一，通常被称为内存墙。这一瓶颈在架构设计中经常被忽视，却对运行效率具有决定性影响</span></strong></p><ul list="u9096a87c"><li fid="u980e6978" data-lake-id="u6e79ba5d" id="u6e79ba5d"><span data-lake-id="uaabdb4d6" id="uaabdb4d6">针对广泛采用的预归一化 Transformer 架构，分析 HC 固有的 I/O 访问模式。分析表明，HC 的访存开销增长倍数近似与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yQvUy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2b491f5d" id="u2b491f5d">成正比。若不借助融合内核缓解，这种过大的 I/O 需求会显著降低训练吞吐量</span></li><li fid="u980e6978" data-lake-id="ua548e763" id="ua548e763"><span data-lake-id="ud7756048" id="ud7756048">由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07375c9910e7b9fb1e747669897c4da2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qMUwc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d1ef18b" id="u7d1ef18b">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38f3cb5e515458146afee58e905e3d14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mpf4B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue103d6a6" id="ue103d6a6">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r4GCO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4ec5cf46" id="u4ec5cf46">涉及可学习参数，反向传播需要保留相应的中间激活。这会显著增加 GPU 显存占用，通常需要采用梯度检查点来将显存用量控制在可承受范围内。进一步而言，HC 在流水线并行中需要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zAdTl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f56a283" id="u2f56a283">倍的通信开销，导致更大的流水线气泡，并降低训练吞吐量</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4cc2ea74" id="u4cc2ea74" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790814433551-8a05d09f-ea1b-4824-ac2f-e3dba6ca9161.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucbf559bb-1ee2-4671-b267-8f3bc2b49a4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2ff2f6a8-4141-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A782.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A279%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A78386%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1124%2C%22originHeight%22%3A401%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2B1)C%2BN2%2B2N(3N%2B1)C%2BN2%2B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A628%2C%22y%22%3A348%2C%22width%22%3A419%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CALCULATEHP%2CHPOS%2CHRES%22%2C%22x%22%3A237%2C%22y%22%3A169%2C%22width%22%3A321%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WRITEELEMENTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A848%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22READELEMENTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A594%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A198%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESIDUALMERGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A302%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A187%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OPERATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOTALI%2FO%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESIDUALMERGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A305%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A182%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22METHOD%22%2C%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONNECTIONS%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A269%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOTALI%2FO%22%2C%22x%22%3A343%2C%22y%22%3A350%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NC%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D%22%2C%22x%22%3A647%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NC%2BN%22%2C%22x%22%3A656%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONNECTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A108%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N2%2B2N%22%2C%22x%22%3A901%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESIDUAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A79%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HYPER-%22%2C%22x%22%3A87%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%2BN%22%2C%22x%22%3A657%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POST%22%2C%22x%22%3A365%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PIE'%22%2C%22x%22%3A328%2C%22y%22%3A208%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A2%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NC%22%2C%22x%22%3A924%2C%22y%22%3A273%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GHRES%22%2C%22x%22%3A368%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222C%22%2C%22x%22%3A675%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222NC%22%2C%22x%22%3A660%2C%22y%22%3A303%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222C%22%2C%22x%22%3A661%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C%22%2C%22x%22%3A919%2C%22y%22%3A203%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NC%22%2C%22x%22%3A924%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B9%9DC%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NC%22%2C%22x%22%3A921%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f4f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ufe46144a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="PEy9V" id="PEy9V" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uc15911c5" id="uc15911c5"> </span><span data-lake-id="u237462a5" id="u237462a5">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="u760483b2" id="u760483b2"> 𝐌𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐟𝐨𝐥𝐝-𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐝 𝐇𝐲𝐩𝐞𝐫-𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐧𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5a374cf6" id="u5a374cf6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b6ff71e" id="u7b6ff71e">受恒等映射原理的启发，mHC 的核心思想是将残差映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wpJSg%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u34724041" id="u34724041">约束到特定流形上。原始恒等映射通过强制</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34cf20e6a0e4232ccd05b3d8f54133eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mkckl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uec574fe1" id="uec574fe1">来保证稳定性，但这也从根本上排除残差流内部的信息交换，而信息交换对于充分发挥多流架构的潜力至关重要</span></strong></p><ul list="u0cac2c3b"><li fid="ub835fcc9" data-lake-id="u53e4e9fc" id="u53e4e9fc"><span data-lake-id="u1ac2e66b" id="u1ac2e66b">因此，提出将残差映射投影到一个流形上，使其既能维持跨层信号传播的稳定性，又能促进残差流之间的交互，从而保留模型的表达能力。将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ya2Z6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd5fd980" id="ubd5fd980">限制为双随机矩阵，即矩阵元素非负，且各行与各列的元素和均为 1。形式上，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F395b93d461c8298c5e59425d5519b6c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qTz3G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud20d96eb" id="ud20d96eb">表示双随机矩阵构成的流形，也称为 Birkhoff 多面体</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u49d936e7" id="u49d936e7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BP%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D)%5C%5Ccoloneqq%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_n%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_n%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_n%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D_n%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cgeqslant%200%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7295995755d0d9a9753cd06238c1f8a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nFETx%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub7b62b9b"><li fid="u409bbb54" data-lake-id="ubdf58369" id="ubdf58369"><span data-lake-id="u1d38875a" id="u1d38875a">需要指出的是，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F69671fd42272c6bf01572cfeaea0f12a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N9ovN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63fdb2a5" id="u63fdb2a5">时，双随机条件退化为标量 1，从而恢复原始恒等映射</span></li><li fid="u409bbb54" data-lake-id="ud37d7a45" id="ud37d7a45"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7316d66b" id="u7316d66b" style="color: #663000">此外，对输入映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07375c9910e7b9fb1e747669897c4da2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y8q3g%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u83b4af50" id="u83b4af50" style="color: #663000">和输出映射</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38f3cb5e515458146afee58e905e3d14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M1ovQ%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uba00af6e" id="uba00af6e" style="color: #663000">施加非负约束。这一约束能够防止正、负系数组合引起的信号抵消，也可视为一种特殊的流形投影</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u870bc558" id="u870bc558"><strong><span data-lake-id="u097e1b9f" id="u097e1b9f">采用双随机约束能够赋予模型若干有利于大规模训练的严格理论性质</span></strong></p><ul list="u83a53fe4"><li fid="u73bec56b" data-lake-id="uc758b8cd" id="uc758b8cd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7907bc61" id="u7907bc61">范数保持性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1e0c0ef0" id="u1e0c0ef0">双随机矩阵的谱范数以 1 为上界，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5C%7C_2%5C%5Cleq%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F88fd5925770d86f3f876cb1abdac0b8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uOwzU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u602dddf3" id="u602dddf3">。这意味着该可学习映射具有非扩张性，能够有效缓解梯度爆炸问题</span></li><li fid="u73bec56b" data-lake-id="u91a061a7" id="u91a061a7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e082f4b" id="u9e082f4b">复合封闭性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufd0e13da" id="ufd0e13da">双随机矩阵集合在矩阵乘法下具有封闭性。这保证跨越多个层的复合残差映射</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BL-l%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_%7BL-i%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fc38ebd543745e2380019815dfaaf72.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o5Csk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucccbb513" id="ucccbb513">仍然是双随机矩阵，从而在模型的整个深度范围内保持稳定性</span></li><li fid="u73bec56b" data-lake-id="uf34edfb1" id="uf34edfb1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u729afeeb" id="u729afeeb">基于 Birkhoff 多面体的几何解释：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u19e9d8a6" id="u19e9d8a6">集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BM%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F395b93d461c8298c5e59425d5519b6c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rTRl6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua14afe03" id="ua14afe03">构成 Birkhoff 多面体，即置换矩阵集合的凸包。残差映射相当于置换的凸组合。从数学上看，反复应用这类矩阵往往会单调增强跨流信息的混合程度，从而有效发挥鲁棒特征融合机制的作用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc4c860ce" id="uc4c860ce"><strong><span data-lake-id="uceac07e5" id="uceac07e5">给定第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6945e109777fe3fd777e8254f0ec0f0c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kIofN%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufddbe8ef" id="ufddbe8ef">层的输入隐状态矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1f4fde4502f47d8d24cc571af01dedfc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PvUYH%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua1e04102" id="ua1e04102">，首先将其展平为向量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%3D%5C%5Ctext%7Bvec%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20nC%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a3d8bcceacd9f966d43bc6f7ab7a72b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OHCyz%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc04bfc26" id="uc04bfc26">，以保留完整的上下文信息。随后，沿用原始 HC 的形式，计算动态映射和静态映射</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ucd550e13" id="ucd550e13" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%3D%5C%5Ctext%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot(%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Cvarphi_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D)%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot(%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Cvarphi_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D)%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Ctext%7Bmat%7D(%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cprime%7D%5C%5Cvarphi_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D)%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e18e9a09e3fec67cb1846d9b177ec36.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IPVCv%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u6d294dbc"><li fid="uc7bd4580" data-lake-id="u4af8df27" id="u4af8df27"><span data-lake-id="u77a8e309" id="u77a8e309">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarphi_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cvarphi_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BnC%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f99e3f3e106f20c115dfca8f81e03e4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rdy8S%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc45d0c70" id="uc45d0c70">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarphi_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BnC%5C%5Ctimes%20n%5E2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb8db704a5270568cf81b6080bd681327.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BulqQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71559da0" id="u71559da0">是用于动态映射的线性投影，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bmat%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a6b6f834ae0d1e7a256cdfd506d87d2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZErbF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29f97636" id="u29f97636">是将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20n%5E2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a26178b240b5356691dbfb2a2cec131.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tYB4Y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf776128b" id="uf776128b">重塑为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%5C%5Ctimes%20n%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7faba7cd8ec219c19074507161a2262c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KL5lN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d3dd15c" id="u1d3dd15c">的函数。随后，通过以下方式获得最终满足约束的映射</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u00592045" id="u00592045" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%3D2%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Ctext%7BSinkhorn-Knopp%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff02355234f379cc2f44cf18fc811fd9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zOKpS%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud355fe56"><li fid="ufc795ba8" data-lake-id="ueba6af4d" id="ueba6af4d"><span data-lake-id="u39e2eb60" id="u39e2eb60">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4084b75627b08e33eeaf0279213d535d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dhVkr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uca8f2da6" id="uca8f2da6">表示 Sigmoid 函数。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BSinkhorn-Knopp%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12a1c4b28ada08e0f833025f942bb938.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tZFbP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub2d2a058" id="ub2d2a058">算子首先通过指数运算使所有元素均为正，然后进行迭代归一化，交替缩放各行与各列，使其元素和为 1。具体而言，以元素均为正的矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D%5E%7B(0)%7D%3D%5C%5Cexp(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9132124a80ab8ead1d8a9ee8cb996d3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mxbGM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1f7b07cb" id="u1f7b07cb">作为初始值，归一化迭代过程为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8463f576" id="u8463f576" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BT%7D_r%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathcal%7BT%7D_c(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D%5E%7B(t-1)%7D)%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d1aeea707313da3ad17dccbbb18430f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A8MFz%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ufae3aae1"><li fid="udbdb1ad3" data-lake-id="u4875df5a" id="u4875df5a"><span data-lake-id="u6d4b0ed5" id="u6d4b0ed5">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BT%7D_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc90aca174d940f396464d890c7ef489a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vlfcb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3749fe79" id="u3749fe79">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BT%7D_c%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe6e78259e31af8833530e8d35b74c2d6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a8nT0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3a18498" id="ua3a18498">分别表示行归一化与列归一化。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bmax%7D%7D%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fd0c257aaa570ec1aafb287ef190899.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22evhjf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uab3d9380" id="uab3d9380">时，该过程收敛为双随机矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D%5E%7B(t_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bmax%7D%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8143eccd9c742c4d1a02bdeb287932a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TK2uF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubce859b4" id="ubce859b4">。实验中，选择</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bmax%7D%7D%3D20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F19be1c6c853d42668dc04bd6257e0faa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oJAX1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8225de6" id="ub8225de6">作为实际迭代次数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u75363eee" id="u75363eee"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ubd403544" id="ubd403544"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe704258" id="ufe704258">mHC 中的 RMSNorm 在处理高维隐状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7B1%5C%5Ctimes%20nC%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3691a3a274b3d82cd2762c19becf5ff6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cdzl3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d2a02a7" id="u6d2a02a7">时会带来显著延迟，因此将除以范数的操作调整到矩阵乘法之后执行。这一优化在保持数学等价性的同时提高效率</span></strong></p><ul list="u344fa778"><li fid="u9e02cf5d" data-lake-id="ue3a0396f" id="ue3a0396f"><span data-lake-id="ua0a41520" id="ua0a41520">采用混合精度策略，在不牺牲速度的前提下尽可能提高数值精度，并将具有共同访存需求的多个操作融合为统一的计算内核，以缓解内存带宽瓶颈</span></li><li fid="u9e02cf5d" data-lake-id="u2416b4e3" id="u2416b4e3"><span data-lake-id="u034e40f5" id="u034e40f5">基于式（10）至式（13）中给出的输入与参数，实现三个专用的 mHC 内核，用于计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F07375c9910e7b9fb1e747669897c4da2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22koV8U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u26b23e25" id="u26b23e25">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38f3cb5e515458146afee58e905e3d14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z0tAk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fe629e3" id="u8fe629e3">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IQ42q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18f7eed6" id="u18f7eed6">。在这些内核中，偏置与线性投影分别合并到 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f72f532a0fb427e879fb175bb1f0086.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p2dVr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a5e8f44" id="u8a5e8f44"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarphi_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6eda7a1e02d50f4e53d08665faf500ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bMfhc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0eaf068" id="ue0eaf068"> 中，RMSNorm 的权重也被吸收到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarphi_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6eda7a1e02d50f4e53d08665faf500ed.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TZ08T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd93d555" id="udd93d555">中</span></li><li fid="u9e02cf5d" data-lake-id="u3cfbdb3a" id="u3cfbdb3a"><span data-lake-id="u586b3964" id="u586b3964">式（14）至式（15）：开发一个统一内核，融合对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7f9419fb005b3d431301a234b64abc97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XdQiO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud3704ab8" id="ud3704ab8">的两次扫描，并利用矩阵乘法单元最大限度地提高内存带宽利用率。包含两次矩阵乘法的反向传播也被合并到单个内核中，从而消除对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7f9419fb005b3d431301a234b64abc97.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hVzeD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5fe5f42a" id="u5fe5f42a">的冗余加载。这两个内核均采用经过精细调优的流水线，包括加载、类型转换、计算和存储，以高效处理混合精度计算</span></li><li fid="u9e02cf5d" data-lake-id="ub5a4f3f7" id="ub5a4f3f7"><span data-lake-id="u0548c75c" id="u0548c75c">式（16）至式（18）：这些针对小规模系数的轻量操作被融合到单个内核中，显著降低内核启动开销</span></li><li fid="u9e02cf5d" data-lake-id="uf901ef40" id="uf901ef40"><span data-lake-id="u72217420" id="u72217420">式（19）：在单个内核中实现 Sinkhorn–Knopp 迭代。对于反向传播，推导一个自定义反向内核，在片上重计算中间结果，并遍历整个迭代过程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4dc71119" id="u4dc71119" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balignedat%7D%7B3%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cvarphi_l%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Btfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%5BnC%2Cn%5E2%2B2n%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(10)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bbfloat16%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%5B1%2CnC%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(11)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%5C%5Ctext%7BScalars%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(12)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%5B1%2Cn%5E2%2B2n%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(13)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%3D%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5C%5Cvarphi_l%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(14)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cnr%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%3D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cvec%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D_l%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%2F%5C%5Csqrt%7BnC%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(15)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%3D1%2Fr%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Calpha_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%2B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bb%7D_l%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(16)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%3D%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(17)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%3D2%5C%5Csigma%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(18)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5Cn%26%3A%5C%5Ctext%7Bfloat32%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26%3D%5C%5Ctext%7BSinkhorn-Knopp%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%26(19)%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balignedat%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa2163bc7c34f53a1dc455175b0f39aff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ha7AV%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4ec32556" id="u4ec32556"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud0f56468" id="ud0f56468">利用上述内核计算得到的系数，引入两个额外内核来应用这些映射：一个用于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Ccoloneqq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpre%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F771b09d8da1d6b6cfd2fdfe876268923.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K0LUM%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u08aa2da1" id="u08aa2da1">，另一个用于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%2Cres%7D%7D%5C%5Ccoloneqq%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_l%2B%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff28fe1201029fafee2b60006a4361eab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ktumI%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u82769111" id="u82769111">。通过将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38f3cb5e515458146afee58e905e3d14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QgVEI%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u25c6574f" id="u25c6574f">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BH%7D_l%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F76f3f6fcede27e43861cf9e7b28940d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HO7mB%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5821cedc" id="u5821cedc">的映射操作与残差合并操作融合，将该内核读取的元素数量从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(3n%2B1)C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F978cd2d7df90152e75809a5bf8929d1d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hoPzl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c1f5210" id="u0c1f5210">降至</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(n%2B1)C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41c6da011ac7f35fc5c4696c327fc879.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KWpQM%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u63817145" id="u63817145">，写入的元素数量从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%223nC%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F978c92396b3bcb387f73620d8e12b1b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c4DEl%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udac4eb7d" id="udac4eb7d">降至</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22nC%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5d713aebbed3eae30fced6dae8937e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J6Qt7%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="bEfKR" id="bEfKR" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u52f88f63" id="u52f88f63">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u6553ec34" id="u6553ec34" style="color: #664900"> </span><span data-lake-id="u10da13b1" id="u10da13b1">𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐫𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐮𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uc4f142e0" id="uc4f142e0"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2ecc807" id="ud2ecc807" style="color: #664900">由于 mHC 内核的重计算以</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F432401e759435dafb7ca3178e2787fff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TH4I8%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u945d4c91" id="u945d4c91" style="color: #664900">个连续层为一组进行，对于总共包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc895173d3be4872abf206be4268a58cb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ejNtn%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u16819afe" id="u16819afe" style="color: #664900">层的模型，需要为全部</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clceil%5C%5Cfrac%7BL%7D%7BL_r%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crceil%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F74684045810773a92033149396f328c7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kB7Ny%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8319d421" id="u8319d421" style="color: #664900">个块持久保存各自的首层输入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl_0%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F933b75894bfabf8bd134fe6930097d7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22svTGU%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub7b1b425" id="ub7b1b425" style="color: #664900">，以供反向传播使用。除这部分常驻显存外，重计算过程还会为当前处理的块引入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(n%2B2)C%5C%5Ctimes%20L_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae8f0b0fff59d713e5b3ae21d39db4ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XtdDQ%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1993fe6" id="uc1993fe6" style="color: #664900">个元素的临时显存开销，这决定反向传播期间的峰值显存占用。通过最小化关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F432401e759435dafb7ca3178e2787fff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zWobe%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3665fc62" id="u3665fc62" style="color: #664900">的总显存占用，确定最优块大小</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_r%5E*%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4258220b009d2c3e572bbc2834578e3a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VDuOW%22%7D" style="color: #664900"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u389df9e1" id="u389df9e1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_r%5E*%3D%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7BL_r%7D%5C%5Cleft%5BnC%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clceil%5C%5Cfrac%7BL%7D%7BL_r%7D%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crceil%2B(n%2B2)C%5C%5Ctimes%20L_r%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Capprox%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7BnL%7D%7Bn%2B2%7D%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B20%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce27a6b810b3a89b28ccb46061fe6d59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Cxk3f%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u44755090"><li fid="udd986927" data-lake-id="ue62f5a9f" id="ue62f5a9f"><span data-lake-id="u95c2bd55" id="u95c2bd55">重计算块不能跨越流水线阶段边界。理论最优值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_r%5E*%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4258220b009d2c3e572bbc2834578e3a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UDGjU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67c28d7b" id="u67c28d7b">通常与每个流水线阶段包含的层数相匹配，因此选择将重计算边界与流水线阶段边界对齐</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udd28067f" id="udd28067f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u68837739" id="u68837739">在大规模训练中，流水线并行是降低参数与梯度显存占用的标准做法</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u947b4cfd" id="u947b4cfd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790815947010-2fec9cb3-addb-4369-b2b9-7971c5fed52c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6dd2d1d4-7e12-4a93-a802-bfde7aa709c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5dfb8239-dc15-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A917.800048828125%2C%22height%22%3A128%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A65529%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1321%2C%22originHeight%22%3A184%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLPBMLPWMLPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A276%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A267%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DISPATCH(FDISPATCH(B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A277%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A258%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NORMALCOMPUTESTREAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IGHPRIORITYCOMPUTESTREAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A118%2C%22width%22%3A219%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(BFOSTR%22%2C%22x%22%3A519%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FPOSTRES(F)FE(F)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1152%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMMUNICATIONSTREAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WRECOMPUTE(B%22%2C%22x%22%3A921%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PPSENDRECV(B%22%2C%22x%22%3A933%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FAOSTRES(F)%22%2C%22x%22%3A708%2C%22y%22%3A149%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FOSTRE(B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1105%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMBINE(B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1128%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMBINEF%22%2C%22x%22%3A585%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WHOLESTAGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A957%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PPSENDRECV(F%22%2C%22x%22%3A736%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTN(E%22%2C%22x%22%3A1127%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E(B)%22%2C%22x%22%3A889%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EF)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1083%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22)FAOSTRES(%22%2C%22x%22%3A1118%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2eee8%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5557aafd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="u76f3a1d5"><li fid="ue883f880" data-lake-id="u9ac9d145" id="u9ac9d145"><span data-lake-id="uab3b7ad5" id="uab3b7ad5">采用 DualPipe 调度，以有效重叠执行横向扩展互连通信，例如专家并行和流水线并行中的通信。然而，与单流设计相比，mHC 的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22M6NNX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u245542b1" id="u245542b1">路残差流在流水线阶段之间引入显著的通信延迟</span></li><li fid="ue883f880" data-lake-id="ud5495b86" id="ud5495b86"><span data-lake-id="ud0be5328" id="ud0be5328">在阶段边界处，对全部</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F432401e759435dafb7ca3178e2787fff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AMR4B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7e190fe" id="ub7e190fe">个层的 mHC 内核进行重计算，会带来不可忽视的计算开销。为解决这些瓶颈，扩展 DualPipe 调度，以更好地在流水线阶段边界处实现通信与计算的重叠。为避免阻塞通信流，将 MLP 层的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bpost%2Cres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2efc613bd57aef26537473b7c7e70d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oolWN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0fd7ebb" id="uc0fd7ebb">内核放在专用的高优先级计算流上执行</span></li><li fid="ue883f880" data-lake-id="u17502765" id="u17502765"><span data-lake-id="u66d5a266" id="u66d5a266">对于注意力层中执行时间较长的操作，避免采用常驻内核（persistent kernels），防止长时间停顿。这一设计使重叠执行的注意力计算能够被抢占，从而支持灵活调度，同时维持计算设备处理单元的高利用率。此外，由于每个阶段的初始激活</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bl_0%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F933b75894bfabf8bd134fe6930097d7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gYeR5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue003d6c4" id="ue003d6c4">已缓存在本地，重计算过程得以与流水线通信依赖解耦</span></li></ul>